tails":"(can't speak any language)","value":["aklo"]},"level":{"value":5},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>A full-grown gibtas uses its powerful legs and rubbery body to bound great distances. Most gibtases remain solitary, unless bonded with a creature.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This rubbery, spheroid scavenger is nearly all acid-dripping mouth, with five bulbous black eyes and two powerful, gangly legs. A gibtas often forms a bond with a single other creature-usually, a more powerful aberration- and serves this master loyally, if erratically. Creatures who keep a gibtas as a pet or guard soon learn to keep it away from any important possessions they don't want spattered with acid.</p>","publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder #164: Hands of the Devil"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":13,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":30,"type":"scent"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":13},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":13},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":11}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":11},"athletics":{"base":12,"special":[{"base":16,"label":"to High Jump or Long Jump","predicate":[{"or":["action:long-jump","action:high-jump"]}]}]},"intimidation":{"base":11},"survival":{"base":11}},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"sm"},"value":["aberration","chaotic"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.abomination-vaults-bestiary.Actor.BJYrYqkV7PkXgSfk"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!XjQJHs2pIkggmmLd","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/abomination-vaults-bestiary/gibtas-bounder.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"abomination_vaults_bestiary__gibtas_bounder","sourcePack":"pf2e.abomination-vaults-bestiary","sourceDocId":"BJYrYqkV7PkXgSfk"}}}